> The output of the program is a bit strange, please try to explain the output of the program.

```c
int main(int argc, char **argv){
    int data1[2][3] = {{0x636c6557, 0x20656d6f, 0x58206f74},
                       {0x756f7969, 0x6e694c20, 0x00000000}};
